PromptCompressor is a standalone extraction and composition of prompt compaction,
compression, caching, token-cost, routing, and spend-governance concepts from the
GALXAI source tree. It does not include GALXAI's application gateway, framework
routes, provider credentials, UI, or deployment runtime.

The standalone package is maintained at:

https://github.com/CardSorting/PromptCompressor

The Apache-2.0 declaration covers the standalone package materials controlled by
the maintainers. It does not relicense third-party dependencies or separately
licensed upstream material; see docs/LICENSING.md and docs/PROVENANCE.md.
